When lamps were first added (2.3), only weapons could be blessed; all
magic lamps, as with (then) glowing potions, had a 20% chance of
granting a wish. 3.0 made blessed magic lamps a 100% wish, then 3.2
made them 80/5/5/5/5 as now, which was some time _after_ the
permalight effect was added in 3.1.

